  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "2674",
  "description": "<p>Engineered for comfort and protection, Rothco's 1/4 Zip Military Fire Retardant NYCO Combat Shirt is crafted with no-melt, drip-resistant fabric, ideal for temperatures up to 230 degrees Fahrenheit. Its lightweight, breathable material wicks moisture away, keeping you dry under heavy body armor. The anti-abrasion elbow patches and elbow pad insert offer added durability and protection, while the durable nylon/rip-stop cotton gusseted sleeves ensure long-lasting wear. With 4\" x 6\" loop attachments on both sleeves, you can easily customize with name tape, rank, and flag patches. The mandarin collar and front quarter zipper provide versatile wear options and easy ventilation during intense activities. Perfect for tactical missions, outdoor adventures, and more.</p>",
